            "heading": "Contract and Identity Documents",
            "body": "A written seafarer employment contract is required by law. You should also hold a Seafarer's Book (선원수첩) recording your service and qualifications, and a Seafarer's Identity Document under ILO Convention No. 185. Keep your own copy of your contract — never hand over your only copy."
